        where your data will be automatically backed up with a server.\n\nYeah, one more thing,
        after that you have to add all your visited countries to the new app manually,
        but it totally worth it, since you will never lose them again.</string>
    <string name="share_title">Share How Many Countries You Have Visited</string>
    <string name="txt_info_home">• Click on \"+\" to add a country.\n• Click on a country to add a
